The current audit script has both reported defects: it labels exits from generic ledger text, and it marks feature release at minute 29 while using New York clock values as Chicago RTH. The existing per-year fill ledgers are available, and `tmux ls` shows no active session. I’ll correct the audit script to pair each native exit fill by fill-row index and reconcile it against both trade ledgers before joining to the evaluation rows. I’ll also add a focused synthetic test for fill pairing and causal as-of availability, then regenerate only the requested report artifacts.
