codex
The pairing logic now reconciles alternating fill rows to `trades.csv` timestamps and then joins each native order type to the evaluation ledger by `(entry_time, exit_time, direction)`. I’ve set complete 30-minute features to release at the next bar open and corrected the RTH window to 08:30–15:00 America/Chicago. Next I’m adding stop-frequency references and the fixed 50-point-to-pre-entry-ATR diagnostic, then I’ll run the script against the frozen ledgers and inspect the reconciliation outputs.
