+              "The table in `metrics.json` compares native STOP probability across terciles of 50 / pre-entry ATR(20), using 2018–2025 matched-season cutpoints. This is a descriptive diagnostic. It does not select or change a stop threshold. Months with no observations in a tercile remain absent.", "",
